          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.33,
          "end": 11.16,
          "en": "Well, as mentioned, we'll use this http object, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.16,
          "end": 12.6,
          "en": "And with the dot notation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.6,
          "end": 13.62,
          "en": "we can now get access",
