          "en": "which you see down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.31,
          "end": 24.99,
          "en": "Now, these methods allow you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.99,
          "end": 29.04,
          "en": "to send different kinds of HTTP requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.04,
          "end": 31.17,
          "en": "Because when you send an HTTP request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.17,
          "end": 32.73,
          "en": "you can configure it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 32.73,
